{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X = \\Spec(R)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0005": "$M$", "MATH_0006": "$R$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-presentation-module}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:191bf435e456e786618992ef990eca09baf4b4fd3617540b38a1fe27c35fc2c0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5f2a9371546aed3c028611851b08f17ffdfb1f07d95fbf864621017fe66983ef", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an affine scheme. The quasi-coherent sheaf\nof <MATH_0002>-modules <MATH_0003> is an <MATH_0004>-module of\nfinite presentation if and only if <MATH_0005> is an <MATH_0006>-module of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b7f2ba364425bc31b1dd4f5fa37ed3de1ef12108b8f6faaacc9d76c8cc6a5a3", "unit_id": "tag:01PC:statement"}
{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01PA", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\widetilde M$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$M$", "MATH_0004": "$R$", "MATH_0005": "$R^n \\to M$", "MATH_0006": "$K$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n0 \\to \\widetilde{K} \\to\n\\bigoplus \\mathcal{O}_X^{\\oplus n} \\to\n\\widetilde{M} \\to 0\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$\\widetilde{K}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0010": "$K$", "MATH_0011": "$R$", "MATH_0012": "$M$", "MATH_0013": "$R$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-module}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-spec-sheaves}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{modules-lemma-kernel-surjection-finite-free-onto-finite-presentation}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-module}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:fa7af84a89718c268330fbeadd9b04fbc064e0edd991fa26b10a1e4ddab08b21", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9b0a6ddd476bfc5ef9793b93cc46e66a8a70ddcd9f20860a1b4a552f81be606f", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is an <MATH_0002>-module of finite presentation.\nBy Lemma <REF_0001> we see that <MATH_0003> is a finite <MATH_0004>-module.\nChoose a surjection <MATH_0005> with kernel <MATH_0006>. By\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0002>\nthere is a short exact sequence\n<MATH_0007>\nBy\nModules, Lemma\n<REF_0003>\nwe see that <MATH_0008> is a finite type <MATH_0009>-module.\nHence by Lemma <REF_0004>\nagain we see that <MATH_0010> is a finite <MATH_0011>-module.\nHence <MATH_0012> is an <MATH_0013>-module of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f4907a3f1cf352f6d1f2ca259c0b646adfef6463f43ee160b9b58280d8f5e67f", "unit_id": "tag:01PC:proof"}
